      {
        "name": "scope",
        "value": "Every third-party operating system, firmware, driver, and package the runbooks and scripts install, fetch, or offer on target machines. CI-only tooling is excluded. Transitive package dependencies are resolved by apt at install time and are not enumerated. OS/firmware version pins live in common/config/os-catalog.env and devices/*/config/versions.env; this file is maintained alongside them."
      }
    ]
